  m_text: "PLAYSTATION CONTROLLER SCHEME:\n\n\u2022 Left Stick - Locomotion\n\u2022 Right Stick - Camera Direction\n\u2022 Square / R1 - Light / Heavy Sword Strike\n\u2022 L1 / L2 - Defensive Guard & Parry\n\u2022 Cross (X) - Dash / Dodge\n\u2022 R3 Click - Lock-on Target\n\u2022 Options Button - Pause Game"
